{
  "key": 44018,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_YayIGotAPalPadAtThePokemonWiFiClubDownstairs",
      "en_US": [
        "Yay! I got a Pal Pad at the\n",
        "Pokémon Wi-Fi Club downstairs!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SwitchOnThePCAtAnyPokemonCenter",
      "en_US": [
        "Switch on the PC at any Pokémon\n",
        "Center.\r",
        "Connect to “Someone’s PC” and access\n",
        "the Pokémon Storage System.\r",
        "That’s all you need to do to store\n",
        "or bring out your Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WhatIsYourFavoriteKindOfTrainerCanYouTellMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm...!\r",
        "What is your favorite kind of Trainer?\n",
        "Can you tell me?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WhichKindOfTrainerWouldYouLikeToBe",
      "en_US": [
        "Which kind of Trainer would you like\n",
        "to be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_AskThisIsTheKindOfTrainerYouWantToBe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kind of Trainer\n",
        "you want to be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_ISeeSoThisIsTheKindOfTrainerYouLike",
      "en_US": [
        "I see! So {STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kind\n",
        "of Trainer you like.\r",
        "If that’s the case, others may come\n",
        "to see you in the same way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_OKThenIllJustTalkToYouLater",
      "en_US": "OK, then I’ll just talk to you later!"
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_HowAboutTellingMeWhatKindOfTrainerYouLike",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! You’ve been mistaken for\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0}, haven’t you?\r",
        "But I think you can also pass for\n",
        "a different kind of Trainer.\r",
        "So, how about telling me what kind of\n",
        "Trainer that you like?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WhatOrWhoIsThisTeamGalacticItsAMystery",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm!\n",
        "What, or who, is this Team Galactic?!\r",
        "They make wonderful claims of a dream\n",
        "energy source on one hand...\r",
        "But rumor has it, they steal Pokémon\n",
        "from others by force.\r",
        "It’s a mystery! They’re mysterious!\n",
        "Isn’t anyone investigating them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WhatOrWhoIsThisTeamGalactic",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm!\n",
        "What, or who, is this Team Galactic?!\r",
        "Lately, they’ve renounced such acts\n",
        "as stealing Pokémon.\r",
        "They’re still involved in developing \n",
        "dream energies, but ethically now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_NowYouCanCaptureItAsABattleVideoUsingAVsRecorder",
      "en_US": [
        "You know how you can battle a friend\n",
        "using wireless communications?\r",
        "Well now, you can capture it as a Battle\n",
        "Video using a Vs. Recorder!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_CoolYouHaveAVsRecorder",
      "en_US": [
        "Cool!\n",
        "You have a Vs. Recorder!\r",
        "So, did you go to the Global Terminal in\n",
        "Jubilife City? Did ya? Did ya?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_HiImGraceTheIdolSoShallWeBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, I’m Grace, the Idol! I’m just back\n",
        "from a show in Oreburgh Mine!\r",
        "So, shall we battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_IllLetYouJoinMyFanClubIfYouCanBeatMe",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll let you join my fan club if you can\n",
        "beat me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_YouWontAcceptMyChallengeButImAnIdol",
      "en_US": [
        "You won’t accept my challenge?!\n",
        "But I’m an Idol..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WellThatsMeAndMyPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, that’s me and my Pokémon!\n",
        "I hope you’ll support us!\r",
        "Just so you know, our latest single is\n",
        "titled “Jigglin’ Pokémon Wub”!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_PlayerLetMeAskYouHowManyPokemonHaveYouMet",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, long time, no see!\r",
        "Oh? You look puzzled.\n",
        "You’re wondering who I am.\r",
        "I’m Professor Rowan’s assistant and\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s father.\r",
        "I’ve come a long way to help you on\n",
        "your adventure at the professor’s\f",
        "behest.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let me ask you,\n",
        "how many Pokémon have you met?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_PlayerLetMeAskYouHowManyPokemonHaveYouMet2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, long time, no see!\r",
        "Oh? You look puzzled.\n",
        "You’re wondering who I am.\r",
        "I’m Professor Rowan’s assistant and\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s father.\r",
        "I’ve come a long way to help you on\n",
        "your adventure at the professor’s\f",
        "behest.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, let me ask you,\n",
        "how many Pokémon have you met?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_ProfessorRowanShouldBeDelightedHereIsSomethingForYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my!\n",
        "You’ve met {STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0} Pokémon!\r",
        "Wonderful! Yes, bravo!\n",
        "Professor Rowan should be delighted!\r",
        "Here is something for you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_APokemonHoldingAnExpShareWillGetSomeOfTheExpPointsFromBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "If you enable the Exp. Share, every\n",
        "Pokémon in your party will receive\f",
        "some of the Exp. Points from battle.\r",
        "It will get Exp. Points even if it didn’t\n",
        "actually battle.\r",
        "Therefore, it should be used to\n",
        "help raise your Pokémon quickly!\r",
        "Also, a Pokémon you get in a trade may\n",
        "disobey you if it is too high in level.\r",
        "Don’t worry, though. It will obey if\n",
        "you have enough Gym Badges."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_YouveGotToFindAtLeast20",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve met only {STRVAR_1 52, 1, 0} Pokémon?\r",
        "Hmm...\n",
        "You’ve got to find at least 20.\r",
        "If you can’t, it will be tough to\n",
        "complete the Sinnoh Pokédex."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
